---
layout: layout.njk
title: Before your Health Check
seo_title: "Book your Production Finance Health Check | Tubes"
description: "A few quick details, then pick a time for your free 45 minute Production Finance Health Check."
permalink: /production-finance-health-check/assessment/
noindex: true
---
{#- De vragenlijst van de Health Check, op een eigen adres zodat de link ook
    los verstuurd kan worden aan iemand die al een sessie heeft staan.

    Twee stappen: eerst wie je bent, dan hoe je werkt. Daarna verschijnt de
    agenda plus een kort overzicht van wat je hebt ingevuld.

    De vragen staan in src/_data/healthcheck.json, te wijzigen via het CMS
    onder "Health Check-vragenlijst". De `key` van een vraag is de veldnaam in
    de opslag; die verander je niet meer zodra er antwoorden binnen zijn.

    Binnenkomen kan op twee manieren:
      ?ref=<id>  vanaf de landingspagina; dan weten we het e-mailadres al.
      kaal       dan vragen we het zakelijke e-mailadres.

    Bewust noindex: een vragenlijst voor genodigden, geen marketingpagina. -#}

<section class="section section-hero theme-light hc-assess-page">
  <div class="container hc-assess-grid">

    <div class="hc-assess-main">
      <span class="kicker">Production Finance Health Check</span>
      <h1>Book your Health Check</h1>
      <p class="hc-lead">{{ healthcheck.intro }}</p>

      <form class="hc-form hc-assess-form" id="hc-assessment" data-hc-assess-form novalidate>
        <input type="text" name="company_website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true" style="display:none" data-1p-ignore data-lpignore="true" data-form-type="other">

        <div class="hc-form-card">
          <div class="hc-progress-line">
            <div class="hc-progress" data-hc-progress>
              <span class="hc-progress-bar is-current" data-hc-progress-bar="1"><span class="visually-hidden">Step 1: {{ healthcheck.step1.title }}</span></span>
              <span class="hc-progress-bar" data-hc-progress-bar="2"><span class="visually-hidden">Step 2: {{ healthcheck.step2.title }}</span></span>
            </div>
            <p class="hc-progress-count" data-hc-progress-label>Step 1 of 2</p>
          </div>

          {#- Stap 1: wie ben je. Het e-mailadres vragen we alleen als we het
              nog niet weten (dus zonder ?ref). -#}
          <section class="hc-block" data-hc-block="1">
            <p class="hc-block-meta"><span class="hc-block-num">1</span> {{ healthcheck.step1.title }}</p>
            <h2 class="hc-block-heading">{{ healthcheck.step1.heading }}</h2>

            <div data-hc-email>
              <label class="hc-field" for="hc-assessment-email">Business email address
                <input type="email" id="hc-assessment-email" name="email" inputmode="email" autocomplete="email" spellcheck="false" required>
              </label>
            </div>

            <div class="hc-field-row">
              <label class="hc-field" for="hc-assessment-name">Name
                <input type="text" id="hc-assessment-name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required>
              </label>
              <label class="hc-field" for="hc-assessment-company">Company
                <input type="text" id="hc-assessment-company" name="company" autocomplete="organization" required>
              </label>
            </div>

            <label class="hc-field" for="hc-assessment-role">{{ healthcheck.role_label }}
              <input type="text" id="hc-assessment-role" name="role" autocomplete="organization-title" placeholder="Line Producer, Head of Production, Financial Controller" required>
            </label>

            <div class="hc-step-actions">
              <button type="button" class="button button-primary hc-next" data-hc-next="2">Continue</button>
            </div>
          </section>

          {#- Stap 2: hoe werk je nu. Daarna verschijnt de agenda. -#}
          <section class="hc-block" data-hc-block="2" hidden>
            <p class="hc-block-meta"><span class="hc-block-num">2</span> {{ healthcheck.step2.title }}</p>
            <h2 class="hc-block-heading">{{ healthcheck.step2.heading }}</h2>

            {%- for question in healthcheck.questions %}
            <fieldset class="hc-choice hc-question" data-key="{{ question.key }}" data-label="{{ question.label }}">
              <legend>{{ question.label }}</legend>
              <div class="hc-choice-row">
                {%- for option in question.options %}
                <label class="hc-pill">
                  <input type="radio" name="{{ question.key }}" value="{{ option }}">
                  <span>{{ option }}</span>
                </label>
                {%- endfor %}
              </div>
            </fieldset>
            {%- endfor %}

            <label class="hc-field hc-assess-notes" for="hc-assessment-notes">{{ healthcheck.notes.label }} <span class="hc-optional">(optional)</span>
              <textarea id="hc-assessment-notes" name="notes" rows="4" placeholder="{{ healthcheck.notes.placeholder }}"></textarea>
            </label>

            <div class="hc-step-actions">
              <button type="submit" class="button button-primary hc-submit">Continue to booking</button>
              <button type="button" class="hc-back" data-hc-back="1">Back</button>
            </div>
          </section>

          <p class="form-status hc-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>

          {#- Na het versturen: eerst de agenda, daaronder wat je invulde. -#}
          <div class="hc-result" data-hc-result data-hc-block="3" hidden>
            <p class="hc-block-meta"><span class="hc-block-num">2</span> Pick a time</p>
            <h2 class="hc-result-heading">{{ healthcheck.result.book_title }}</h2>
            <p class="hc-result-intro">{{ healthcheck.result.book_text }}</p>
            <a class="button button-primary hc-book" href="/book-a-call/health-check/">{{ healthcheck.result.book_label }}</a>
            <p class="hc-done-note">We will email your confirmation and the video link once you have picked a time.</p>

            <div class="hc-report">
              <h3 class="hc-report-heading">{{ healthcheck.result.heading }}</h3>
              <div class="hc-result-focus" data-hc-result-focus data-title="{{ healthcheck.result.focus_title }}"></div>
              <ol class="hc-result-list" data-hc-result-list></ol>
            </div>
          </div>

          <p class="hc-privacy">Your details go to Tubes and stay with us. We use them to arrange your Health Check, to prepare for the session and to follow up on what we find, and we keep them in our own system. We do not sell them and we do not share them for anyone else's marketing. Ask us to delete them at any time. See how we handle data in <a href="/compliance/">security and compliance</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>

    <aside class="hc-assess-aside">
      <div class="hc-theme">
        <span class="hc-theme-kicker">The session</span>
        <h2 class="hc-theme-title">{{ healthcheck.result.next_title }}</h2>
        <ol class="hc-next-list">
          {%- for item in healthcheck.result.next %}
          <li>{{ item }}</li>
          {%- endfor %}
        </ol>
        <p class="hc-scan-note">{{ healthcheck.result.note }}</p>
      </div>
    </aside>

  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/booking-modal.njk" %}
